    "4. Derek reviews CLI #2 report (human gate)",
    "5. Approved patterns → Vertex AI LoRA fine-tune",
    "6. Fresh adapter pushed back to Omni Neural on Razr",
    "7. Docker CLI #2 writes lessons to /nova/wiki/patterns/"
  ],
